{"id":"a722d09fe9b7b184","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra.md","title":"部分组合代数的精确 K、S 条件","display":"df-partial-combinatory-algebra — 部分组合代数的精确 K、S 条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra","aliases":["72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra"],"display":"df-partial-combinatory-algebra — 部分组合代数的精确 K、S 条件","depends_on":["[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.2 axioms and §2.3 remark, print423–424/PDF435–436","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source clauses and partial-term interpretation checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-combinatory-algebra — 部分组合代数的精确 K、S 条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03defc006c104890\" href=\"?note=03defc006c104890\" title=\"72-df-applicative-term-evaluation\">72-df-applicative-term-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.2 axioms and §2.3 remark, print423–424/PDF435–436"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source clauses and partial-term interpretation checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,G,\\mathcal T_X,c_a,\\mathsf{ap},E_G,\\simeq_{G,\\eta}\">\\(X,G,\\mathcal T_X,c_a,\\mathsf{ap},E_G,\\simeq_{G,\\eta}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03defc006c104890\" href=\"?note=03defc006c104890\" title=\"72-df-applicative-term-evaluation\">72-df-applicative-term-evaluation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,s\\in X\">\\(k,s\\in X\\)</span>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"tu\">\\(tu\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ap}(t,u)\">\\(\\mathsf{ap}(t,u)\\)</span>，多次应用向左结合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 任取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^\\omega\">\\(X^\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PCA}(X,G,k,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;k\\ne s\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\ \\bigl[(c_kc_a)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\land E_G(c_kc_ac_b,\\eta,a)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\ \\bigl[(c_sc_a)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\land(c_sc_ac_b)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in X\\ \\bigl[c_sc_ac_bc_c\\simeq_{G,\\eta}(c_ac_c)(c_bc_c)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PCA}(X,G,k,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;k\\ne s\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\ \\bigl[(c_kc_a)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\land E_G(c_kc_ac_b,\\eta,a)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\ \\bigl[(c_sc_a)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\land(c_sc_ac_b)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in X\\ \\bigl[c_sc_ac_bc_c\\simeq_{G,\\eta}(c_ac_c)(c_bc_c)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>K 的两次应用必须总有值；S 的前两次应用也必须总有值，第三次与右式弱相等。若只写“右式有值则左式有值”，就失去本书所用的部分项等价。所有显示项闭合，条件与 η 的选择无关。按原书此处要求 k、s 互异，排除退化的一元素结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-applicative-term-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"03defc006c104890","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-applicative-term-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"03defc006c104890","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,G,\\mathcal T_X,c_a,\\mathsf{ap},E_G,\\simeq_{G,\\eta}$ 取 [[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]]；$k,s\\in X$。以下 $tu$ 缩写 $\\mathsf{ap}(t,u)$，多次应用向左结合，$\\eta$ 任取 $X^\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,G,\\mathcal T_X,c_a,\\mathsf{ap},E_G,\\simeq_{G,\\eta}","display":false},{"tex":"k,s\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"tu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ap}(t,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"X^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PCA}(X,G,k,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &k\\ne s\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\ \\bigl[(c_kc_a)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\land E_G(c_kc_ac_b,\\eta,a)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\ \\bigl[(c_sc_a)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\land(c_sc_ac_b)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in X\\ \\bigl[c_sc_ac_bc_c\\simeq_{G,\\eta}(c_ac_c)(c_bc_c)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1789,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-ter